  "notes": [
    "The active WBStartup tool and the optional Copper tool are byte-identical. The Aminet archive also supplies the guide and the active S: presets.",
    "The checked BCWB payload supplies the icons, active preferences, and customized Expansion preferences and presets.",
    "Workbench launches the active icon with DELAY=1. The optional Copper icon specifies DELAY=2000. Both use the built-in Shift+Alt+C hotkey.",
    "The installer retains ownership of the active Workbench pattern preferences and shared Prefs/Patterns drawer."
